  m_text: '1. Press ''START AR'' to open your camera.


    2. Open the dragon reference
    image on your laptop screen or print it on paper.


    3. Point your phone camera
    at the reference image.


    4. The 3D Dragon will spawn in real world space
    at the image location!


    5. Use the on-screen joystick on the bottom-left
    to move and turn your dragon.


    6. Press ''Reset Dragon'' anytime to bring
    the dragon back to the image.'
